 "key_insight": "Petify is an all-pet advert board whose Staffy hubs are thin search shells: its Staffy stud page listed no adverts and carried no breed text, and the site's own pages show no licence, health-test or review proof. BSUK can beat it on the Liverpool search it ranks for with a real Liverpool page backed by one breeder's visible proof and a direct way to enquire."
